sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI
    participant AuthService
    participant ThirdPartyProvider
    participant EmailService

    User->>UI: Click Register/Login
    UI-->>User: Show form / third-party options
    User->>UI: Fill in form or select third-party
    alt Third-party login
        UI->>ThirdPartyProvider: Send auth request
        alt Authorization successful
            ThirdPartyProvider-->>UI: Auth token
            UI->>AuthService: Validate third-party token
            AuthService-->>UI: Login successful
            UI->>User: Redirect to homepage or previous page
        else Authorization denied
            ThirdPartyProvider-->>UI: Error (denied)
            UI->>User: Show failure reason, allow retry
        end
    else Traditional registration/login
        UI->>AuthService: Send credentials
        alt Credentials valid
            AuthService-->>UI: Login successful
            alt Email not verified
                UI-->>User: Prompt to verify email, restrict features
            else Email verified
                UI-->>User: Redirect to homepage or previous page
            end
        else Credentials invalid or duplicate email
            AuthService-->>UI: Error (invalid, duplicate, etc.)
            UI-->>User: Highlight form errors, block submission
        end
    end
    alt API error or network issue
        AuthService--xUI: Error
        UI-->>User: Show friendly error, allow retry
    end
